WEBVTT

00:15:29.724 --> 00:15:33.340
The most powerful
institutions of this world

00:15:33.364 --> 00:15:38.367
have no intention of changing the game
they're profiting from most,

00:15:38.391 --> 00:15:41.133
so there's no point
in further relying on them.

00:15:42.308 --> 00:15:43.817
That's scary, I know.

00:15:44.341 --> 00:15:48.351
That's a huge responsibility, a huge
burden on everyone's shoulders, yes.

00:15:49.716 --> 00:15:51.584
But this also means,

00:15:51.608 --> 00:15:53.063
if we want to,

00:15:53.857 --> 00:15:55.722
we can have a say in this.

00:15:57.191 --> 00:16:00.251
We can be part of that change.
We can be part of that answer.